  "question": {
    "text": "The pH of $10^{-4} \\mathrm{M}$ KOH solution will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "4",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "11",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "10.5",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "10",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$10^{-4} \\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{KOH}=10^{-4} \\mathrm{M}\\left[\\mathrm{OH}^{-}\\right]$\r\nWe know that\r\n$$\r\n\\left.\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right] \\mathrm{IOH}^{-1}\\right]=1 \\times 10^{-14}\r\n$$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{c}\r\n{\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right] \\times 10^{-4}=1 \\times 10^{-14}} \\\\\r\n{\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]=\\frac{1 \\times 10^{-14}}{1 \\times 10^{-4}}=1 \\times 10^{-10} \\mathrm{M}} \\\\\r\n\\mathrm{pH}=-\\log \\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]=-\\log \\left(1 \\times 10^{-10}\\right) \\\\\r\n=10\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$"
  }
}